  "|Debentures in a company's balance sheet are classified as:|Current assets|Non-current liabilities (long-term borrowing)|Shareholders' equity|Current liabilities": "companies",
  "|The accounting equation after a credit sale of ₦50,000 on 30-day terms becomes:|Assets increase by ₦50,000; Liabilities decrease by ₦50,000|Assets (debtors) increase by ₦50,000; Revenue (equity) increases by ₦50,000|Assets decrease; Equity decreases|No change in accounting equation": "nature-concepts",
