  "|Cost accounting entails provision of information|for investment purpose|for decision making|to shareholders|to stockholders": "nature-concepts",
  "|The main objective of accounting report is to provide information about|a company's shareholding|an entity's management|the efficacy of assets|a company's economic resources": "nature-concepts",
  "|If liabilities amounted to ₦12,045, other assets ₦36,800 and equity ₦26,896, the cash at hand would be|₦2,241|₦2,214|₦2,141|₦2,114": "nature-concepts",
  "|Use the following information: \nFixed assets ... ₦85,600\nSales ... ₦197,000\nStock ... ₦34,300\nSalaries and wages ... ₦37,000\nPurchases ... ₦127,700\nShare capital ... ₦120,000\nCreditors ... ₦16,050\nMotor expenses ... ₦10,500\nDebtors ... ₦25,000\n\nWhat is the cash balance?|₦12,095|₦12,590|₦12,950|₦21,800": "trial-balance-errors",
