  "|Use the following information: \nIncome and Expenditure Account\nExpenditure: Wages ₦12,000; Electricity ₦5,000; Depreciation: Furniture ₦1,000; Other expenses ?; Excess of income over expenditure ?; Total ₦35,000\nIncome: Subscriptions received ₦20,000; Donations received ₦10,000; Profit on sale of investment ₦5,000; Total ₦35,000\nIt is the tradition of the club to write off an amount equal to 25% of the subscriptions received as other expenses.\n\nWhat is the amount to be written off as other expenses?|₦4,500|₦6,000|₦4,000|₦5,000": "not-for-profit",
